#
# Sysbuild defaults of the UNIMOC module: the STM32H7 boards run MCUboot, so
# that a firmware update over Cyphal (docs/system_plan.md, firmware update)
# swaps the image in the second flash bank in. The simulation has no
# bootloader.

choice BOOTLOADER
	default BOOTLOADER_MCUBOOT if BOARD_NUCLEO_H743ZI || BOARD_UNIMOC_JACOBI
endchoice
